  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.7: Add .NET 11 (net11.0) target framework support and full public API documentation:\n- net11.0: Added as a fourth target framework (net8.0;net9.0;net10.0;net11.0); System.IO.Hashing referenced explicitly (net11 targeting pack does not expose Crc32 built-in).\n- Analytics: Enabled strictest AnalysisMode=All + TreatWarningsAsErrors with documented .editorconfig suppressions; real code fixes for CA1032 (QzdbException ctors), CA1062 (GeoInfo null guard), CA1859 (ChainedReader ReadOnlyCollection); EnforceCodeStyleInBuild intentionally not enabled (non-portable under ProjectReference).\n- Package validation: baseline moved to 1.0.6; ApiCompat confirmed no breaking API change.\n- Documentation: Full XML docs for all public API members (CS1591 clean, 13KB→56KB XML).",
